{"id":218708,"bangumiId":218708,"type":2,"name":"宇宙よりも遠い場所","name_cn":"比宇宙更远的地方","date":"2018-01-02","year":"2018","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/16/de/218708_99YjL.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/16/de/218708_99YjL.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/16/de/218708_99YjL.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/16/de/218708_99YjL.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/16/de/218708_99YjL.jpg"},"summary":"无论何时，我们的第一步总是从好奇心开始。\r\n不曾看过的风景，不曾听过的声音，不曾闻过的味道，不曾摸过的质感，不曾尝过的食物，以及不曾感受过的澎湃。\r\n为了重拾不知何时忘却的记忆碎片和不知何时舍弃的感动的旅途。\r\n在到达终点的时候，我们会想些什么呢？\r\n40度的咆哮，50度的疯狂，60度的呐喊，跨越荒芜的海源到达原生地域。\r\n在地球的天边，远离文明的南方尽头。\r\n这是向南极（比宇宙更远的地方）进发的四位女孩子的旅行物语。我们通过她们回想起生于明日的光辉！","rating":{"rank":150,"total":16028,"count":{"1":40,"2":15,"3":27,"4":70,"5":195,"6":733,"7":2538,"8":6131,"9":4530,"10":1749},"score":8.2},"collection":{"on_hold":1345,"dropped":406,"wish":7439,"collect":23672,"doing":1978},"tags":[{"name":"原创","count":4208,"total_count":635583},{"name":"MADHouse","count":3489,"total_count":112424},{"name":"青春","count":3384,"total_count":110169},{"name":"2018年1月","count":2251,"total_count":31836},{"name":"花田十辉","count":1999,"total_count":21330},{"name":"TV","count":1939,"total_count":1443519},{"name":"治愈","count":1661,"total_count":308444},{"name":"南极","count":1585,"total_count":1588},{"name":"2018","count":1164,"total_count":79288},{"name":"百合","count":1156,"total_count":413672},{"name":"励志","count":994,"total_count":29216},{"name":"花泽香菜","count":831,"total_count":43603},{"name":"水濑祈","count":626,"total_count":1427},{"name":"早见沙织","count":561,"total_count":6693},{"name":"井口裕香","count":298,"total_count":2544},{"name":"日本","count":224,"total_count":313485}],"eps":13,"total_episodes":13,"aliases":["比宇宙更远的地方","宇宙よりも遠い場所","小南极","去南极","比宇宙更遥远的地方","Sora yori mo Tooi Basho","A Place Further Than the Universe"],"sourceType":"bibliography","nsfw":false,"annualRank":8,"sourceYear":2018,"sourceUrl":